    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/04f404faf9dd5b3bd6aed130aaec24a7.poster.avif?t=1749762744\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/04f404faf9dd5b3bd6aed130aaec24a7.webm?t=1749762744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dew is an atmospheric 2.5D platformer adventure set in a realistic micro-environment. As a mysterious</i> <strong>creeping mold</strong> <i>is destroying and corrupting the living, two tiny heroes,</i> <strong>Myric </strong><i>and</i> <strong>Dewey</strong> <i>join forces to stop it and the source of evil behind it.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Single player or Co-op. Play with a less experienced player and let them &quot;ride with you&quot; through the more challenging parts.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic side-scrolling platformer with recognizable controls.\u00a0Dodge, dash, double jump, slide and hang glide your way through the dangerous paths.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlock powerful new skills to traverse uncharted paths and confront even greater dangers.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0Explore a variety of beautiful levels, accompanied by an atmospheric score.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/75ebc46217fa72b534c0d0ecf18d1bff.avif?t=1749762744\" width=640 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore a world inspired by the beauty of nature seen from a macro perspective, find secret</i> <strong>paths</strong> <i>and earn</i> <strong>rewards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Symbiotic Skills</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utilize the symbiotic skills of</i> <strong>Myric</strong> <i>and</i> <strong>Dewey</strong> <i>to traverse the world and overpower enemies.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overpower and cure the cute, yet</i> <strong>creepy characters</strong> <i>infected by the dangerous</i> <strong>creeping mold.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maintaining the Balance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn perks by solving</i> <strong>puzzles</strong> <i>to restore the environment or help characters in need.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect magic</i><strong>\u00a0dew drops</strong> <i>and send them through the</i> <strong>mycelium network</strong> <i>that maintains the balance in the world.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/7e730ffe406d1dd718e80e725c4df5aa.poster.avif?t=1749762744\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/7e730ffe406d1dd718e80e725c4df5aa.webm?t=1749762744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/04f404faf9dd5b3bd6aed130aaec24a7.poster.avif?t=1749762744\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/04f404faf9dd5b3bd6aed130aaec24a7.webm?t=1749762744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dew is an atmospheric 2.5D platformer adventure set in a realistic micro-environment. As a mysterious</i> <strong>creeping mold</strong> <i>is destroying and corrupting the living, two tiny heroes,</i> <strong>Myric </strong><i>and</i> <strong>Dewey</strong> <i>join forces to stop it and the source of evil behind it.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Single player or Co-op. Play with a less experienced player and let them &quot;ride with you&quot; through the more challenging parts.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic side-scrolling platformer with recognizable controls.\u00a0Dodge, dash, double jump, slide and hang glide your way through the dangerous paths.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unlock powerful new skills to traverse uncharted paths and confront even greater dangers.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0Explore a variety of beautiful levels, accompanied by an atmospheric score.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/75ebc46217fa72b534c0d0ecf18d1bff.avif?t=1749762744\" width=640 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore a world inspired by the beauty of nature seen from a macro perspective, find secret</i> <strong>paths</strong> <i>and earn</i> <strong>rewards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Symbiotic Skills</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Utilize the symbiotic skills of</i> <strong>Myric</strong> <i>and</i> <strong>Dewey</strong> <i>to traverse the world and overpower enemies.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overpower and cure the cute, yet</i> <strong>creepy characters</strong> <i>infected by the dangerous</i> <strong>creeping mold.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maintaining the Balance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn perks by solving</i> <strong>puzzles</strong> <i>to restore the environment or help characters in need.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect magic</i><strong>\u00a0dew drops</strong> <i>and send them through the</i> <strong>mycelium network</strong> <i>that maintains the balance in the world.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/7e730ffe406d1dd718e80e725c4df5aa.poster.avif?t=1749762744\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654640/extras/7e730ffe406d1dd718e80e725c4df5aa.webm?t=1749762744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dew is a 1-2 player Co-op Adventure with classic 2D Platformer mechanics set in a stunningly beautiful realistic micro-environment. Play as two tiny unlikely heroes, Myric and Dewey and stop the evil forces that is spreading a creeping mold that is infecting all living in their world.",
